{"about_the_game":"Light puzzle game inspired by mini-golf. Navigate each level with a limited number of clicks/taps to guide the cockroach to the food gate. It involves some logic and, at times, quick action to seize the moment. Expect a few surprises!<br><br><strong>OVERALL</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to play: Just click/tap, and the cockroach moves to that location.<br></li><li>69 levels.<br></li><li>Progressively increasing difficulty.<br></li><li>Enjoyable character animations.<br></li><li>Hats selection.</li></ul><br><strong>LEVEL FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clever puzzles.<br></li><li>Need for quick reflexes.<br></li><li>Unique obstacles.<br></li><li>Outsmart the enemies.<br></li><li>Falling rocks.<br></li><li>2 secret rooms.</li></ul><br><strong>ORIGIN</strong><br>Back in 2009, I developed a game titled &quot;Clickroach&quot; for my brother\u2019s gaming site. It was a real success for me because it gained a fair amount of popularity. The current game revisits that original concept. There's a similarity between cockroaches and ideas: neither of them ever dies. Enjoy!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908270/bb3259097088be3f6e75f28117917c1113ea45d9.jpg"},{"name":"Neutralize with Laser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908270/ed56f086e83fb20071faab4c2689bb0a6ba0fb5f.jpg"},{"name":"Neutralize with Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908270/de4c02daff27fbf358531f5460da46244f72fcfd.jpg"},{"name":"Meet Beetle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908270/a9a68009b2d285f7377a9cf201e20c7336c2f1ce.jpg"},{"name":"Start a Fight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908270/367ab283ff2365353ea87ec26518f6f857ec6bc9.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Room #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat